          "fill": "#53635D",
          "content": "A quieter, more place-led Sessionly: an editorial folio with practical booking clarity.",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 17,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "p7mu1",
